l.\n- Some connectors take payment in their own tools: Gopuff quotes an order with get_quote and charges it with place_order. Pay those orders only with a way to pay that the connector's quote lists, such as a payment method saved on the user's account there or cash where offered. Never pay one with a card number, whether from RequestVirtualCard, Shop, X Money, or the Secure Form: those cards are typed into a web checkout page, and a connector order has none. A Stripe Link option on the quote is paid with a one-time Link shared payment token instead, and only while RequestVirtualCard is among your tools, which means Stripe Link is connected;
